OL,3,AAnthropic shares jump sharply with AI
OL,4,Afirm's value close to $2tn at start of
OL,5,Atrading
OL,6,
OL,7,FAI firm Anthropic is being listed
OL,8,Fpublicly for the first time on Thursday
OL,9,Fon the Nasdaq stock market in New York
OL,11,FTrading has begun, with the company's
OL,12,Fshare price starting at $111.50, which
OL,13,Fat that stage gave it a market value
OL,14,Fclose to $2tn - prices have since
OL,15,Fdropped back slightly to nearer $100 a
OL,16,Fshare
OL,18,FThat's still a steep jump from the $83
OL,19,Fset last night - take a closer look at
OL,20,Fsome of the numbers here
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
